        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oc",
          "text": "What is Premises Liability?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9of",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oe",
          "text": "Premises liability is a segment of personal injury law. It deals with property owners and the duty they have to provide reasonably safe premises for visitors to their premises. Premises liability is often a complex and confusing area of the law because property owners do not owe the same duty of care to every visitor upon their premises.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ok",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l9oh",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.courts.state.co.us/userfiles/file/Court_Probation/Supreme_Court/Committees/Civil_Jury_Instructions_Committee/Chapter%2012.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9og",
          "text": "There are three types of visitors recognized by ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oi",
          "text": "Colorado law",
          "marks": [
            "l9oh"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oj",
          "text": ". Visitors are either invitees, licensees, or trespassers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9om",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ol",
          "text": "The duty of care owed to each visitor is generally as follows:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9op",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9on",
          "text": "Invitees.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oo",
          "text": " Invitees are typically retail customers on a premises by expressed or implied invitation of the owner. Owners and operators of businesses need to maintain a reasonably safe property for invitees.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9os",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9oq",
          "text": "Licensees.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9or",
          "text": " Licensees are usually social guests or enter a property with the owner’s permission for their purposes. Owners owe licensees a duty to protect or notify them of dangerous conditions that they know of or should know of.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b9ov",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ot",
          "text": "Trespassers.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s9ou",
          "text": " Trespassers enter a property without the owner’s permission or authorization. Owners owe trespassers little or no duty.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
